{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Flow Timer 是一款專為 ADHD 族群設計的雙重計時與任務管理工具，打破傳統線性思維限制。其靈活視覺化介面讓使用者能同時運行前台專注與後台背景計時器，完美平衡多工需求。目前提供限時免費下載，原價為 US $0.99，協助你無縫切換工作模式。</p>\n\n<h2>雙重計時無縫切換</h2>\n<p>Flow Timer 允許同步啟動多個計時器，例如烹飪同時學習或洗衣搭配閱讀，透過自訂預設快速開啟常用時段。任務清單可直接啟動計時，消除拖延摩擦；「距上次」與「距下次」習慣追蹤以非侵入式方式提醒日常事項，完成時更有彩帶特效獎勵，讓專注過程充滿成就感且無壓力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-86-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Flow Timer: Tasks &amp; Lofi</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T13:18:04.822962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}